{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"weak"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"id<MLNMapSnapshotterDelegate>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Qoobjc(pl)MLNMapSnapshotterDelegate"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"delegate"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The delegate is responsible for responding to significant changes during the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"snapshotting process, such as the style loading. Implement a delegate to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"customize the style that is depicted by the snapshot.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You set the delegate after initializing the snapshotter but before receiving","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the snapshot, typically before starting the snapshot. The snapshotter keeps a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"weak reference to its delegate, so you must keep a strong reference to it to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ensure that your style customizations apply."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter\/delegate","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The snapshotter’s delegate."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapSnapshotter(py)delegate","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"delegate","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier",